OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with an early
OL,7,Ffrost. Staying dry in the west
OL,8,Fovernight but a few showers will feed
OL,9,Finto eastern parts, particularly
OL,10,Ftowards Caithness. Freshening easterly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with scattered
OL,14,Fshowers at first, turning to longer
OL,15,Fperiods of rain and hill snow in the
OL,16,Fsouth. Drier with some showers in the
OL,17,Fnorth. Fresh easterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
