OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday starts rather cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome patchy rain, dry and bright
OL,8,Fspells developing before some showers
OL,9,Flater. Thursday and Friday chilly but
OL,10,Foften dry and bright, some showers in
OL,11,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
